  "notes": "Podcast interface. Host and Guest mic inputs are XLR. Speaker outputs L/R are 6.35 mm TRS. Headphone outputs are 6.35 mm on the front. Camera Out is a 3.5 mm TRS jack, Phone is a 3.5 mm TRRS jack (4-pole; listed as 3.5 mm TRS because the app has no TRRS type yet). Bluetooth audio not listed. Routing: all sources are mixed to the outputs, camera, phone and computer. Controls from the user guide, 'Hardware features': one multi-function knob sets the gain of either microphone (shown here once per mic), per microphone Auto Gain, Enhance and Mute buttons, a Host knob (host headphones and the speaker outputs) and a Guest knob (guest headphones), 48V and Bluetooth buttons on the rear. Modelled: MUTE stops that microphone everywhere. Whether 48V feeds both mic inputs is assumed. Assumption: levels at MIN are silent.",
